What's the best kids streaming service overall?

Netflix and Disney Plus may be the go-to streamers in your household, which wouldn't be surprising since each platform sports a diverse selection of family-friendly TV shows and movies. But there are other streaming services with worthwhile kids entertainment to consider. To decide on a winner, we looked at streamers that offer a mix of educational and fun programming, while also providing parental tools to ensure the content being watched is age-appropriate. Disney Plus is the standout; however, it's certainly not the only option.

We put each of the streaming platforms in our list, below, to the test, based on subscription cost, content libraries, ad load times and safety features like parental controls. Each streamer featured in this list is jam-packed with solid TV shows and movies, with some operating as entertainment hubs for your kids' favorite characters. If you're on the hunt for the streaming service that may be the right fit for your family, read on for our in-depth guide.

