Long wait times for new, original TV series Disney Plus offers a wide variety of family-friendly content, including shows and movies from Disney, Marvel, Star Wars, Pixar, National Geographic, Disney Junior and Disney Channel. Everything is easily accessible through the streamer's navigation menu, which can be broken down by category, title, character or genre. Keep toddlers occupied with animated and live-action Disney classics. Tweens and teens can enjoy The Proud Family, Bluey, Spidey and his Amazing Friends, Gravity Falls, Turning Red and the Mouse House's lineup of blockbusters. Parents can add a four-digit PIN to set rating limits on profiles. Creating a kid's profile automatically curates appropriate content for all ages. The Kid-Proof exit feature adds an extra layer of security, preventing profile switching. Disney Plus' $12 ad-supported tier features commercials on many titles. However, there are several ways to enjoy ad-free streaming. ... Show more Get it now $12 at Disney Plus

