Easy to use across devices Cons Some full episodes not available PBS Kids has been the go-to for childhood favorites like Sesame Street for decades. Characters like Elmo, Arthur (the longest-running animated kids' show in history), Daniel the Tiger and Curious George entertain and teach. Despite Netflix being the new home for Sesame Street, new episodes are still available on PBS Kids. The service is free for Prime Video subscribers and available on The Roku Channel. Parents can download the PBS Kids video app for free on a mobile device or TV. That means your children can stream shows like Elmo or Wild Kratts, whether on the couch or on the go. ... Show more Get it now See at PBS Kids

